# ingest tooling: the DuckDB venv the Overture extract needs (docs/evidence/places/README.md's
# Reproduce block), and its outputs. The extract is ~50 MB of parquet / ~1 MB of CSV per city and is
# reproducible from the pinned release, so none of it belongs in the repo.
venv/
*.parquet
*-extract.csv
*-copy.csv

# tooling output
playwright-report/
test-results/
.vercel/
.supabase/
.DS_Store
tests/manual/.shots/

# Claude Code: the project's shared configuration (.claude/settings.json, .claude/agents/,
# .claude/hooks/) IS checked in — it is part of how this repo is built (docs/claude-code-setup.md).
# Only the per-machine override file and Claude's own scratch state stay out.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/state/

# competitor research kept out of the repository by owner ruling (2026-08-27). The raw crawl of a
# competitor's site, bundle and store listings is working material, not a project artefact, and one
# of the sites' robots.txt asks agents not to fetch it — so it stays on the machine that gathered
# it. The FINDINGS that survived review live in docs/current-state.md; only the raw material is here.
docs/evidence/.local/

# Superseded drafts of the submission documents. The graded set lives at docs/*.html;
# every earlier revision stays on disk here and in git history, but off the tree.
docs/.drafts/
